        "Nespresso machine (Vertuo / Barista)." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_225)
        "Epson EcoTank or WorkForce printer (Wi-Fi Direct or BLE)." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_226)
        "Shokz bone-conduction headphones (OpenRun / OpenFit). Worn on the head, not a tracker." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_227)
        "In-flight drone digital license plate (ASTM / FAA Remote ID). Decoded fields can show ID, position, heading, and operator. Pattern match, not a tail number. Wi-Fi Remote ID often misses on stock Android." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_228)
        "Skydio drone (common in US public-safety / enterprise). In-flight Remote ID is often Wi-Fi and easy to miss — the Remote ID row is the license plate." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_229)
        "Autel drone, controller, or setup Wi-Fi. In-flight digital license plate is the Remote ID row." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_230)
        "Parrot ANAFI or Bebop drone. In-flight digital license plate is the Remote ID row. Not a Parrot car kit." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_231)
