        "Ericsson Cradlepoint vehicle router (IBR / R-series). Common in US police and public-safety fleets; also utilities, EMS, and commercial fleet. Hidden or renamed SSIDs still hit on the CradlePoint IEEE OUI. Pattern match, not that agency or that car. Look with your eyes." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_234)
        "Sierra Wireless AirLink vehicle / fleet gateway. Common in public-safety and commercial fleets. Hidden SSIDs still hit on the board vendor." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_235)
