        "Novatel Wireless / Inseego OUI 28:80:A2. Reported in public-safety vehicle AP work. Same prefix is also on some Inseego consumer MiFi radios. Pattern match, not that agency. Look with your eyes." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_240)
        "Utility, Inc vehicle or public-safety access point." -> UiText.text(R.string.catalog_241)
